# Intent: Higher or Lower (spec docs/design/higher-or-lower.md, rank 1 of docs/plan/more-games.md): a shuffled deck of 52, one card face up; the person says Higher or Lower, the next card is turned over; right adds one to the streak, the same rank is a push, wrong ends the game on Game over with the streak (owner decision 33). Two new header-only files: the pure core (deck, answers, odds hint, finger-size buttons) and the screen drawn by the very code the host renderer compiles. Registering the game, the touches, the sounds (tick, good, bad), the best score and the game-over call are the firmware track's.
